{
  "project": "井口真理子命案：她没能回家",
  "voice_id": "pending-selection",
  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "file": "S01.mp3",
      "text": "她走出高雄车站，随后失去行踪，亲友再无音讯。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 0,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "file": "S02.mp3",
      "text": "离开车站后，她去了哪里？这个疑问，至今未解。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 5,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "file": "S03.mp3",
      "text": "一九九〇年四月，她带着期待独自飞来台湾，展开一段毕业旅行。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 10,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "夜市灯火暖，人声渐远，她把旅途见闻写进明信片，记下此刻心情。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 17,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "来到台南后，李姓司机热心接待她，也邀请她到家中借宿。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "在台南，她提笔写下旅途见闻，向家人报平安。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "四月七日清晨，李先生送她上车，她挥手道谢，车站一切如常。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 35,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "车窗外稻田不断后退，她手里仍握着明信片，沿途光影掠过窗边。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "中午，她离开高雄车站；此后行踪，公开资料难以确认。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 49,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "原定四月十八日返日，她没有登上那班飞机。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 55,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "四月二十五日，母亲久子飞抵台湾，带着照片四处寻找女儿下落。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "久等不到女儿返日的消息，警方成立专案；她把希望交给警方。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 67,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，最后见过她的李姓司机被反复询问，核实后获释。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 74,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "墓园与甘蔗田一次次搜过，仍没有她的消息。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 80,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "一九九一年三月四日，警方在高雄将刘学强逮捕归案。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 85,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "file": "S16.mp3",
      "text": "供述称，他在车站看见独自一人的她，随后主动上前搭话。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 91,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "file": "S17.mp3",
      "text": "据刘学强供述，白天他带她游览景点，逐渐取得她的信任。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 97,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "file": "S18.mp3",
      "text": "据供述，那一夜屋里灯光熄灭；镜头只停在门外。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 103,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "file": "S19.mp3",
      "text": "那只深蓝色大背包，也在此后失去踪影，镜头停在空房间。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 108,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "黄色出租车驶过空巷，警方仍在追查反复变化的供词。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "他反复改口，警车驶向错误地点，搜寻仍无结果。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "供词指向多个地点，警方只能逐一核对线索。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 125,
      "target_duration": 5,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "三月七日深夜，组长王家儒独自留下，准备换一种方式谈，静待突破。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 130,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，警车在台南与高雄之间奔波一夜，天色渐亮仍屡屡扑空。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 137,
      "target_duration": 7,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "据报道，谈到唯一的儿子，他沉默许久，终于说出地点。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "三月九日清晨，警方在树根下挖出一百多块骨骸。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "鉴定确认了身份；母亲的目光，缓缓落在女儿的遗物上。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "据供述，头颅被垃圾车运走；掩埋场的搜寻最终停止。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
      "text": "一九九三年，母亲带着女儿的骨灰离开台湾，踏上归乡之路。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 168,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    },
    {
      "id": "S30",
      "file": "S30.mp3",
      "text": "刘学强被判无期；近年报道中，假释申请未获准，她没能回家。",
      "voice_id": "pending-selection",
      "sha256": null,
      "target_start": 174,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "status": "pending"
    }
  ],
  "target_duration": 180,
